enefits of  better looking destruction levolution  could be a great way to create a  climactic moment in any given round  a visual turning point showing that the  home stretches in sight  now i know it's not for everyone and i'm  sure there are those who didn't care  or felt that levolution in particular  could grow stale after a while  but battlefield 6 could have a solution  to taking the dynamism up another notch  through a revamped weather system the  rumor is that the weather system will  incorporate natural disasters in the  form of massive storms  we've gotten slight glimpses of extreme  weather in battlefield 4 with huge  rainstorms causing choppier surf like in  paracel storm  leading to less accurate naval combat  and tougher visibility  but battlefield 6 might even go so far  as to include weather ranging from  storms  all the way to straight up tornadoes now  if or when these rumors are confirmed  and battlefield 6 is revealed  we can get a gauge into the scope of how  dramatic this extreme weather could get  but as far as i'm concerned  this stuff sounds absolutely bat crazy  it's tornadoes it's certainly a lot to  be excited and optimistic about  especially if dice can play the cards  right  there's also no official word yet if  battlefield 6 will come out on last gen  consoles  my hope is that it stays next-gen  exclusive so there's more effort on  pumping out as much visual fidelity in  the destruction as possible  we'll have a better idea of what will  actually be possible in battlefield 6 in  the coming days  and we'll be sure to share our thoughts  and impressions of everything we see  so what did you prefer the organic  destruction of that company  levolution from battlefield 4 or even  those massive behemoths from battlefield  1. be sure to sound off into the  comments and tell us what kind of  destruction you'd like to see  in battlefield 6. now here's some quick  examples of my favorite evolutions from  battlefield 4 to close us off  because they're just that good thanks  for watching  [Music]  objective  [Music]  so  [Music]  so  you

